<title>PORTUGAL: PORTUGUESE UNEMPLOYMENT FELL IN JULY.</title>
<headline>PORTUGUESE UNEMPLOYMENT FELL IN JULY.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of registered unemployed in Portugal fell 1.4 percent to 428,948 in July compared with the previous month, the Institute for Employment and Professional Training (IEFP) said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>					July 1997  June 1997   July 1996</p>
<p> Registered unemployed	   428,948    435,048	455,314</p>
<p>NOTE - The IEFP does not express the number of unemployed as a percentage of the workforce. -- Lisbon bureau 3511-3538254</p>
</text>
